From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: CoreXGT <aulia.ikbal09@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 21:36:00 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] Settings: declare config_gesture_settings_enabled (cm-13.0 shim)

cm-13.0 port shim.

The nikel device tree ships cm-14.1 era overlays, and
packages/apps/Settings/res/values/config.xml is one of them. It overrides
config_gesture_settings_enabled, a resource that only exists in
cm-14.1's Settings, so aapt refuses the overlay:

  error: Resource at config_gesture_settings_enabled appears in overlay
  but not in the base package; use <add-resource> to add.

The "Gestures" settings screen does not exist on Android 6.0.1, so the
resource is only declared so aapt accepts the overlay; Settings never
reads it.

Change-Id: I0000000000000000000000000000000000000002
---
 res/values/config.xml | 5 +++++
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+)

diff --git a/res/values/config.xml b/res/values/config.xml
--- a/res/values/config.xml
+++ b/res/values/config.xml
@@ -102,5 +102,10 @@
     <bool name="config_enableManualSubProvisioning">true</bool>
 
     <!-- Does the device allow updating the recovery. -->
     <bool name="config_enableRecoveryUpdater">true</bool>
+
+    <!-- nikel cm-13.0: the "Gestures" settings screen does not exist on
+         Android 6.0.1, but the nikel overlay (written for cm-14.1) overrides
+         this resource. Declare it so aapt accepts the overlay. -->
+    <bool name="config_gesture_settings_enabled" translatable="false">false</bool>
 </resources>
--
2.53.0
